<div class="finance-fields"><div class="field"><label>计划起始日期</label><input type="date" name="start_date" value="<%= params.start_date %>" required></div><div class="field"><label>每月还款日</label><input type="number" name="due_day" min="1" max="31" value="<%= params.due_day %>" required></div><div class="field"><label>剩余期数</label><input type="number" name="term_n" min="1" max="600" value="<%= params.term_n %>" required></div><div class="field"><label>名义年利率（%）</label><input type="number" name="annual_rate" min="0" max="100" step="0.001" value="<%= params.annual_rate %>"></div></div><div class="field"><label>预计还款方式</label><select name="method"><% [['equal_payment','等额本息'],['equal_principal','等额本金'],['interest_only','先息后本'],['manual','特殊合同：按银行逐期计划录入']].forEach(([v,n])=>{ %><option value="<%= v %>" <%= params.method===v?'selected':'' %>><%= n %></option><% }); %></select></div><p class="help">计划金额仅作预计。实际还款按银行本金、利息及手续费分别核销。</p>

<div class="finance-manual-fields mb16"><h3>银行逐期还款计划</h3><p class="help">仅银行提供特殊逐期金额时填写。每行依次为还款日期、本金、利息、手续费，金额单位元，以逗号分隔。示例：2026-12-20,1000,30,0。本金合计须等于剩余本金。</p><div class="field"><label>逐期金额</label><textarea name="manual_schedule" rows="5" placeholder="2026-12-20,1000,30,0"></textarea></div></div>
